<div
  class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-r from-red-50 via-zinc-100 to-zinc-50 p-4 sm:p-6 border border-red-200 shadow-xs"
>
  <div
    class="relative z-10 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center justify-between gap-4"
  >
    <div class="flex items-start gap-3.5 min-w-0">
      <div
        class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-red-600 text-white flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 shadow-xs"
      >
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[22px]">priority_high</span>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col min-w-0">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 flex-wrap">
          <h3 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-zinc-900 leading-snug">
            Atención requerida: Tu ciclo venció el 10 de Octubre
          </h3>
          <span
            class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-red-600 text-white text-[11px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-wide"
            >Inactivo</span
          >
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-600 mt-1 leading-relaxed">
          La respuesta automática por WhatsApp para <strong
            >Main Street Cafe</strong
          > se pausará en breve si no se renueva el plan. Tus conversaciones entrantes
          se mantienen en cola.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 shrink-0 w-full md:w-auto">
      <a
        class="w-full md:w-auto flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-orange-500 hover:bg-orange-600 text-white text-sm font-bold shadow-xs transition-all cursor-pointer"
        href="/checkout/payment?plan=pro&billing=annual"
      >
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">autorenew</span>
        <span>Renovar Plan Ahora</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
